WEBVTT

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:11.680
<v Student>Vox, I’m buried. My circuits lab report’s due Friday at five, and I need ninety minutes.

00:00:11.989 --> 00:00:19.599
<v Vox>Let’s get it out of your head. Circuits lab report, Friday at five, ninety minutes. Check the details, then save.

00:00:19.749 --> 00:00:21.300
<v Student>Looks right.

00:00:27.089 --> 00:00:31.139
<v Student>Now fit it around my classes and library shift. Keep tonight free.

00:00:31.299 --> 00:00:37.760
<v Vox>Thursday, two to three-thirty works. That leaves tonight free. Review this plan before I apply it.

00:00:38.689 --> 00:00:39.520
<v Student>That works.

00:00:45.159 --> 00:00:50.139
<v Vox>Your study block is saved. The report’s planned around your commitments.

00:00:50.429 --> 00:00:52.979
<v Student>Okay. That actually feels doable.
